    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent is due, so is the maintenance fee, and you need money for groceries too. But you're just a broke college dropout with a cute Jester girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately for you, there is a CoulroFans, a fetish adult site focusing on clowns and jesters that takes donations from fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide it is time to earn a living through building your account on the site. This will require recording and uploading various content such as this:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523700/extras/c3ae19247581acf3f838fb9190b81557.avif?t=1741938665\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>CoulroFans</i>, you'll have to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Earn money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pay bills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Train your girlfriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Film content to upload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Take your girlfriend on dates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Manage her health and happiness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Buy items and gifts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-As well as help your girlfriend with life issues she faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For money problems aren't the only thing you and she has. Her gambling, alcoholic father is due to get out of prison, and you'll have to deal with whatever baggage he bring along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features not just dating sim and money management but also decision making as the plot progresses. Your decisions have impact on outcome of certain events that could not only provide advantages or disadvantages but also affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
